  "goodToKnow": "Der Referent (die Referentin) is a speaker at an event or a presenter: der Referent des Abends. In ministries and organisations, a Referent is a policy officer or adviser responsible for a specific area, das Referat (department). German school pupils give a Referat, a class presentation. Der Pressereferent is a press officer. It's a weak noun: den Referenten. False friend: a reference is eine Referenz."
